        "interval": 15,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:8px;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">Leadership</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Executive health</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Are we healthy? What value is the platform providing?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>01 - Platform Value Overview</strong></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">NOC / Ops</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Triage alerts</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Which alerts require action now?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>03 - Alert Overview</strong></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">Ops</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Environment risk</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Where is risk concentrated?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>02 - Environment Health</strong></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">Admins / FinOps</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Coverage &amp; licenses</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Are there blind spots or license pressure?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>04 - Coverage, Capacity &amp; Licenses</strong></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">Security</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Access hygiene</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Idle users, tokens, empty roles?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>06 - Access and Administration</strong></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:16%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#38bdf8;font-weight:700;\">Platform engineers</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;\">Collector pipeline</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Is monitoring data still flowing?</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;color:#e5e7eb;\">Open <strong>07 - Collector Health</strong></div></td></tr></table></div>"
      }
